          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Camera Preview" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the preview placeholder, and the accessibility label when no camera is selected.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Live-Kameravorschau"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vista previa de cámara en vivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live preview of %@" : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility label for the preview frame naming the selected camera.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Live-Vorschau von %@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vista previa en vivo de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS grants each permission to this app. Tingra Cameras checks again whenever it becomes active, so a change made in System Settings appears here when you return, and the preview starts on its own. Reset forgets a decision, so macOS asks again the next time a camera opens." : {
      "comment" : "Permissions settings: footer explaining when the statuses update and what Reset does",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS erteilt jede Berechtigung dieser App. Tingra Cameras prüft sie erneut, sobald die App aktiv wird. Eine in den Systemeinstellungen vorgenommene Änderung erscheint hier also bei der Rückkehr, und die Vorschau startet von selbst. „Zurücksetzen“ vergisst eine Entscheidung, sodass macOS beim nächsten Öffnen einer Kamera erneut fragt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS concede cada permiso a esta app. Tingra Cameras vuelve a comprobarlo cada vez que se activa, así que un cambio hecho en Ajustes del Sistema aparece aquí al volver y la vista previa se inicia sola. Restablecer olvida una decisión, así que macOS vuelve a preguntar la próxima vez que se abra una cámara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone" : {
      "comment" : "Permissions settings: the microphone permission's name",
